 false),\r\n                        Milestone(\"M4\", \"Asphalt Road Surface Relaying & Pavement\", \"30 May 2025\", false)\r\n                    ),\r\n                    isFollowed = true\r\n                )"}'::jsonb) on conflict do nothing;
